BT 0 g /F1 22 Tf 32 434.57 Td (Summary) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 399.43 Td (Choosing a chunk size stays a trade-off. Small chunks match a question precisely) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 373.43 Td (but lose the surrounding meaning quickly. Large chunks keep the context but dilute) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 347.43 Td (the embedding, because they cover several topics at once.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 309.43 Td (A starting value of 400 to 800 tokens with ten to twenty percent overlap has proven) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 283.43 Td (itself. Headings, tables and code blocks should not be cut apart: a splitter that) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 257.43 Td (breaks at paragraphs and sections almost always finds better matches than a rigid) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 231.43 Td (window.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 193.43 Td (One problem, however, no chunk size solves: every chunk is embedded on its own) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 167.43 Td (and does not know what comes before it in the document. This is where the next) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 141.43 Td (chapter starts.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
