12 0 obj
<< /Length 981 >>
stream
BT 0 g /F1 22 Tf 32 434.57 Td (Reranking as a second stage) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 399.43 Td (Contextual retrieval improves which candidates are found at all. A reranker then) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 373.43 Td (decides which of them really fit the question. For this, the best 150 hits from vector) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 347.43 Td (and BM25 search are merged and scored again by a cross-encoder.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 309.43 Td (Only the top 20 chunks then go into the prompt. That costs one extra request per) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 283.43 Td (search but noticeably lowers the retrieval error rate, especially for questions that) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 257.43 Td (touch several sections of a document.) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 219.43 Td (Context, hybrid search and reranking can be introduced step by step: first the) Tj ET
BT 0 g /F1 16.5 Tf 32 193.43 Td (context, then BM25, finally the reranker. Each stage can be measured on its own.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
